1
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:07,160
Night one. Real customers show on camera.

2
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,043
Serve them.

3
00:00:08,323 --> 00:00:09,251
Refuse the rest.

4
00:00:11,651 --> 00:00:14,465
Ten skewers. Cook them until they stop talking.

5
00:00:15,515 --> 00:00:17,077
He's on camera. Good.

6
00:00:18,615 --> 00:00:19,905
Ten. Coming up.

7
00:00:21,915 --> 00:00:22,403
Payment.

8
00:00:22,683 --> 00:00:23,155
...That's a leaf.

9
00:00:23,435 --> 00:00:24,111
Very valuable.

10
00:00:29,415 --> 00:00:32,503
Iced tea. Less sugar. Less... you.

11
00:00:33,553 --> 00:00:34,300
...No. No no no.

12
00:00:36,803 --> 00:00:38,506
Refuse! REFUSE!

13
00:00:40,403 --> 00:00:41,253
Close it! Close it!

14
00:00:42,603 --> 00:00:43,326
Don't open it.

15
00:00:46,703 --> 00:00:48,433
Nothing. There's nothing there.

16
00:00:49,703 --> 00:00:50,361
...Gone.

17
00:00:52,903 --> 00:00:55,182
Night two. Can you spot them before I do?
